    Rebuild the site in React, with the menu and prices in a Google Sheet
    
    - React 19 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 storefront (RTL Arabic), replacing the plain HTML/JS site (kept in legacy/)
    - Cart with per-item notes, upsell, reorder, open/closed status, search/sort, dark mode, PWA/offline, share image
    - Menu, prices, offers, sold-out/hidden flags, opening hours and delivery fee are read from a Google Sheet (Apps Script web app); no backend needed
