    - Local fake Google Sheet for development (npm run sheet:fake / dev:sheet) and 100+ tests
    - Old Cloudflare admin design archived in archive/cloudflare-admin
    - Local password file (dev.vars.MY-LOCAL-COPY) is git-ignored

